  "notes": "ISU-ILCC dataset (251 cells) studying capacity fade against charge rate, discharge rate and depth of discharge (landing page). Cycling, RPT and interpolated-capacity files per cell; the README describes the capacity normalization. Appendix A1 documents a maximum cycling charge rate of 3.000C and discharge rate of 2.475C across the released groups; reference performance tests use C/5 and C/2. The author text in section 3.3 calls the discharge step constant-voltage but also refers to CC discharge; this wording is unresolved and no discharge protocol class is inferred from it. QV_charge/QV_discharge contain V/I/t curves, not only per-cycle capacity summaries; the cached extraction reports qv_curves for all 251 entities but leaves n_rows=0."
 },
